{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/06/13/5354981/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は幕張メッセにて握手会でした\n来てくださった皆様、ありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17枚目ラストの個別握手会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/06/13/5354981/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/06/13/5354981/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/06/13/5354981/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくださいました\n毎回毎回、本当に嬉しいです(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17枚目の握手会何だかあっという間に\n感じました\n自分の中で17枚目は1つでも成長できた部分と\nまだまだこれじゃダメだと感じられる\n期間だったなあとしみじみ思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て17枚目の握手会は\n終わりかと思っていたけど\n全国握手会があと1回残っている事を\n皆様に教えていただきました\n(ちゃんと把握してけよってツッコミは\nいりません)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は誰とペアになるのかなあ、\n楽しみです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５月生まれの方(書き漏れしてしまいました）\n申し訳ありません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライライベァーさん\nはなくん（カピパラ）さん\nあゆみさん\nさとむさん\nはしこさん\nHIRO6228さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして玲香さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めましておめでとうございます(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/06/13/5354981/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}